{
  "uid": "newsagent-observability",
  "title": "NewsAgent 全链路与模型定位",
  "tags": [
    "newsagent",
    "observability",
    "local-only"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "10s",
  "editable": false,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "服务",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "newsagent-prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(target_info, service_name)",
          "refId": "service"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "定位顺序：入口 Trace → Activity → 工具/检索 → 模型阶段 → 业务校验",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**先确认采集链健康，再定位业务失败。** 模型 `success` 只代表推理/JSON/Schema 通过，可信性仍看业务校验。日志详情点击 TraceID；Trace 的 Logs 图标回查同 trace 日志。无数据表示尚未启用 SDK 或没有调用，不能视为成功。此栈仅供本地，数据暂存有界内存，停止即清空。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "模型调用速率",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "newsagent-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(newsagent_model_calls_total{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "模型错误比例",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "newsagent-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(newsagent_model_calls_total{service_name=~\"$service\",newsagent_outcome=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(newsagent_model_calls_total{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "模型时延 p95",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "newsagent-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(newsagent_model_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Token 使用速率（类型分开）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "newsagent-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (gen_ai_token_type) (rate(newsagent_model_tokens_total{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_token_type}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "模型错误阶段与分类",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "newsagent-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (model_scene, newsagent_stage, error_type) (rate(newsagent_model_calls_total{service_name=~\"$service\",newsagent_outcome=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model_scene}} / {{newsagent_stage}} / {{error_type}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "模型时延 p95（场景 / 路由）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "newsagent-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, model_scene, model_route) (rate(newsagent_model_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model_scene}} / {{model_route}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "业务校验失败：推理成功仍可能不可信",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "newsagent-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (newsagent_operation, error_type) (rate(newsagent_operation_calls_total{service_name=~\"$service\",newsagent_operation=~\".*validat.*\",newsagent_outcome=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{newsagent_operation}} / {{error_type}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "全链路阶段时延 p95",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "newsagent-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, newsagent_operation) (rate(newsagent_operation_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{newsagent_operation}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Activity / 工具 / 检索错误",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "newsagent-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (newsagent_operation, error_type) (rate(newsagent_operation_calls_total{service_name=~\"$service\",newsagent_outcome=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{newsagent_operation}} / {{error_type}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "采集链健康：1 = 抓取成功",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "newsagent-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{job=~\"newsagent|otel-collector|tempo|loki\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "日志：展开结构化属性与 TraceID",
      "type": "logs",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "newsagent-loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"$service\"}",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "错误 Trace：点击进入瀑布与 Logs",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "newsagent-tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceqlSearch",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name =~ \"$service\" && status = error }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "各阶段判断",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 45,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "`prompt_render`：模板/输入绑定；`inference`：模型 Port 或 HTTP；`timeout / connection / rate_limit / http_error`：供应端/网络；`response_decode`：JSON；`schema_validation`：结构；`model_binding`：路由/版本；`hot_news.analysis.validate`：指标/证据/因果可信性。用 span 版本和受控错误码归因，不采集正文、Prompt、模型回答或异常原文。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Prometheus 告警（默认端口）",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:29090/alerts",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ]
}
